WEBVTT

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:05.800
Right now, healthcare work
is going out to tender.

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:09.300
Most of it is found too late.

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:14.720
The hard part was never the work.
It was the finding.

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:24.400
Qura pulls live procurement
from Find a Tender,

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:27.400
Contracts Finder, TED and SAM.gov.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:28.560
Every morning.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:30.950
Each notice linked back
to the original.

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:37.100
Over a thousand named decision-makers
across three hundred organisations.

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:41.260
Find one person, then walk
the trust around them.

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:46.600
One profile, every compliance
document in one place.

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:48.300
Registered means they told us.

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:50.220
Verified means a person checked.

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.400
Introductions only open
after that check.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:55.870
So when a conversation starts,
it is a real one.

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:00.100
Qura.

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:02.500
Live healthcare demand,
and the people behind it.

00:01:02.590 --> 00:01:06.590
Connect. Engage. Win.
